# {{ project_name }}

A Python CLI project generated from [dev-templates/python-cli](https://github.com/asher-tian/dev-templates/tree/main/python-cli).

## Requirements

- Python {{ python_version }} or a compatible version satisfying `pyproject.toml`
- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/)
- Docker Desktop and VS Code Dev Containers (optional)

## Setup

```bash
uv sync --all-groups
```

## Run

```bash
uv run {{ package_name }}
# or
uv run python -m {{ package_name }}.cli
```

## Checks

```bash
uv run pytest
uv run ruff check .
uv run ruff format --check .
```

Add runtime dependencies with `uv add <package>` and development dependencies with `uv add --dev <package>`. Commit both `pyproject.toml` and `uv.lock`.

## Development environment

The `.devcontainer/` directory provides a Linux-based VS Code development environment. Open the project in VS Code and choose **Dev Containers: Reopen in Container**.
